# This repository is CONTENT ONLY: the CSV/Lua registry, the ~1750 .map terrain files, SObj.tbl. Everything
# here is authored, is identical on every deployment, and is READ-ONLY to a running server.
#
# It used to also be the directory the server WROTE into — the SQLite database, the character store, the
# staff rosters and the logs all sat alongside these files — and most of this .gitignore was the list of
# runtime filenames that had to be kept out of the history. That list is gone because the thing it was
# guarding against is gone: live state now lives in state/, a sibling of this repo's working directory that
# nothing here can see (see Shared/RepoPaths.cs in Project1998, and docs/hosting.md §1 in Project1998-infra).
#
# The one guard kept below is for the case where somebody points P1998_STATE back at a content checkout. It
# should never happen, and committing a database full of player accounts into the content repo is expensive
# enough to be worth three lines of insurance.
project1998.db
project1998.db-*
chars/
*.log

# ---- Editor/tool backups made before a bulk CSV rewrite ----
# The rewritten file is the content; the pre-image is scratch. Includes the one-off *.pre-<thing>-restore
# snapshots taken before a destructive bulk edit.
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
*.pre-*
